      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>types</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a> used to initialize the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/ManagedTypes.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ManagedTypes</code></a>; must not be\n         null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>new instance of <a href=\"CassandraManagedTypes.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>CassandraManagedTypes</code></a> initialized the given, required <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> of\n        <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>types</code></a>.</dd>",
